  "description": "Free FTP/FTPS client and class library available on any platform supporting .NET Standard 2.0+. Written to overcome the limits of .NET's System.Net.FTPWebRequest in terms of FTPS support.",
  "id": "RaFtpsClient",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-02T23:30:59.55Z",
